> expand (x-1)^20
  ucas: expand (x-1)^20
expand (x - 1)^20
  = x^20 - 20x^19 + 190x^18 - 1140x^17 + 4845x^16 - 15504x^15 + 38760x^14 - 77520x^13 + 125970x^12 - 167960x^11 + 184756x^10 - 167960x^9 + 125970x^8 - 77520x^7 + 38760x^6 - 15504x^5 + 4845x^4 - 1140x^3 + 190x^2 - 20x + 1
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> expand (x+y)^8
  ucas: expand (x+y)^8
expand (x + y)^8
  = x^8 + 8x^7*y + 28x^6*y^2 + 56x^5*y^3 + 70x^4*y^4 + 56x^3*y^5 + 28x^2*y^6 + 8x*y^7 + y^8
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> factor x^3 + 3*x^2 + 3*x + 1
  ucas: factor x^3 + 3*x^2 + 3*x + 1
factor x^3 + 3x^2 + 3x + 1
  = (x + 1)^3
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
  (factors are irreducible over the rationals)
> factor x^4 - 1
  ucas: factor x^4 - 1
factor x^4 - 1
  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + 1)
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
  (factors are irreducible over the rationals)
> factor x^6 + x^3 + 1
  ucas: factor x^6 + x^3 + 1
factor x^6 + x^3 + 1
  = x^6 + x^3 + 1
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
  (factors are irreducible over the rationals)
> factor x^100 - 1
  ucas: factor x^100 - 1
factor x^100 - 1
  = x^100 - 1
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> factor x^2 - 2
  ucas: factor x^2 - 2
factor x^2 - 2
  = x^2 - 2
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
  (factors are irreducible over the rationals)
> cancel x/x
cancel x/x
  = 1
  holds where x != 0 (cancelled there)
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> cancel (x^2-1)/(x-1)
cancel (x^2 - 1)/(x - 1)
  = x + 1
  holds where x - 1 != 0 (cancelled there)
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> expand (x-1)*(x-2)*(x-3) - (x^3 - 6*x^2 + 11*x - 6)
  ucas: expand (x-1)*(x-2)*(x-3) - (x^3 - 6*x^2 + 11*x - 6)
expand (x - 1)*(x - 2)*(x - 3) - (x^3 - 6x^2 + 11x - 6)
  = 0
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> apart 1/(x^2-1)
apart 1/(x^2 - 1)
  = 1/(2(x - 1)) - 1/(2(x + 1))
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> together 1/x + 1/(x+1)
together 1/x + 1/(x + 1)
  = (2x + 1)/(x*(x + 1))
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> collect x^2*y + x*y^2 + x + y in x
collect x^2*y + x*y^2 + x + y
  = x^2*y + (y^2 + 1)*x + y
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
